      "section": "Meridian mirror workshop",
      "snippet": "# Meridian mirror workshop\n\nThis handbook covers the workshop's removable observatory mirrors. It does not prescribe work on permanently mounted lenses.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
