    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-eff60728a44196b3daa2ce0d",
      "path_or_url": "optics.md",
      "section": "Meridian mirror workshop > Packing a mirror > Cooling",
      "snippet": "### Cooling\n\nLeave the mirror on its padded bench for forty minutes before wrapping it. Do not start wrapping while the surface remains warmer than the room.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "b58281a44098c5486796bf797c9a3ee1b25cfcc27877bf476b015f93bb213192",
      "project_identity": "local:2085e4d8de8a2ba87264a14e78f55a203b96516a8e22907b434946b684aa1685",
      "line_start": 9,
      "line_end": 12,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/533b42d4761ab7a7a07fc273"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-2e4c9db32bac6caddf9d79b2",
      "path_or_url": "optics.md",
      "section": "Meridian mirror workshop > Packing a mirror > Wrapping",
      "snippet": "### Wrapping\n\nPlace acid-free tissue against the reflective face, followed by a rigid cover. Never put adhesive tape directly on the reflective coating.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "3368876b9799900abca7c4c8a044c020decd831fdeadd07ddaedc05f396f64be",
      "project_identity": "local:2085e4d8de8a2ba87264a14e78f55a203b96516a8e22907b434946b684aa1685",
      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 16,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/ac77a6145d99cdfaa4e684e3"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-8524e2d3832b910987744bb2",
      "path_or_url": "optics.md",
      "section": "Meridian mirror workshop > Packing a mirror > Crate closure",
      "snippet": "### Crate closure\n\nFasten both brass latches and have a second technician record the crate number before moving it to dispatch.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "a0c2f6ea688982c5fa0248792f16102fa5b2005bc38c6ebaf80ba0a3e97d8616",
      "project_identity": "local:2085e4d8de8a2ba87264a14e78f55a203b96516a8e22907b434946b684aa1685",
      "line_start": 17,
      "line_end": 20,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/90e4fdae31d96e0c54d89ff7"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-5dffc0b0491d6483c1098cc2",
      "path_or_url": "optics.md",
      "section": "Meridian mirror workshop > Packing a mirror > Bench accessories",
      "snippet": "### Bench accessories\n\nThe bench pencil cup is violet. Replacement pencils are stored in drawer six; their colour is not an inspection result.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "206fd5d977082543fd5bd81f771b3eef5d30e960cafda2bebff95ceee8f5b166",
      "project_identity": "local:2085e4d8de8a2ba87264a14e78f55a203b96516a8e22907b434946b684aa1685",
