      "evidence_id": "ev-7957567ed99e3a615cb81b70",
      "path_or_url": "optics.md",
      "section": "Meridian mirror workshop > Crack restriction",
      "snippet": "## Crack restriction\n\nA mirror with a visible edge crack must remain in the inspection room, even if both crate latches are fastened. Obtain the optics supervisor's written release before moving that mirror to dispatch.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
